### Ahorratron API Example Calls

# Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Add a transaction (replace <API_KEY> with your key)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/add_transaction
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{$dotenv api_key}}

{
  "amount": "$12.345",
  "date": "2025-07-13T12:00:00",
  "payee": "Supermercado Lider",
  "notes": "Compra mensual"
}

### Get summary (replace <API_KEY> with your key)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/summary
X-API-KEY: {{$dotenv api_key}}
Accept: application/json

### Get summary for a specific month (replace <API_KEY> and <YYYY-MM-DD>)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/summary?month=2025-07-01
X-API-KEY: {{$dotenv api_key}}
Accept: application/json
